

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:18
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_5c55ea21:

    # "... The bells rang that day as panic filled the streets of Novaras."
    "... Las campanas resonaron aquel día mientras el pánico llenaba las calles de Novaras."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:20
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_1e4510e5:

    # "The sky turned a red crimson as the dark forces of the Demorai marched to the beat of thousands of war drums that could be heard for miles around."
    "El cielo se tornó de un carmesí intenso mientras las fuerzas oscuras de los demorai marchaban al ritmo de miles de tambores de guerra que se escuchaban a kilómetros a la redonda."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:21
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_a7ff46eb:

    # "As the Demorai forces slammed against the walls with great catapults and scorched beasts, the Alderian men stationed valiantly fought back."
    "Mientras las fuerzas de los demorai embestían los muros con enormes catapultas y bestias calcinadas, los hombres alderianos apostados allí luchaban valientemente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:22
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_45dae7fc:

    # "The Demorai had yet to breach the walls, yet from the sheer volume of men heading up towards the top of the great walls of Novaras, and from the screams above and sounds of bolts firing and blades clashing, the battle was an intense one."
    "Los demorai aún no habían logrado romper las murallas, pero por la enorme cantidad de hombres que subían hacia la cima de los grandes muros de Novaras, y por los gritos que se escuchaban arriba, junto al zumbido de virotes y el choque de las espadas, la batalla era intensamente feroz."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:23
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_6f8f0543:

    # "Every now and then, a loud scream rang out followed by a sharp thud as one of the men high up on the wall fell, coming sharply crashing into the ground and reduced to bloody piles of gore."
    "De vez en cuando, un grito desgarrador resonaba en el aire, seguido por un golpe seco cuando uno de los hombres en lo alto del muro caía, estrellándose violentamente contra el suelo y quedando reducido a un montón sangriento de carne y huesos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:31
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_ae7df25f:

    # GUARD "Captain Nyx has sent me to escort you to her at once!"
    GUARD "¡La capitana Nyx me ha enviado para escoltarte hasta ella de inmediato!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:33
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_5e36eb7d:

    # MC @ serious "Lead the way."
    MC @ serious "Muestra el camino."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:45
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_2b5141de:

    # MC @ surprised "Captain Nyx!"
    MC @ surprised "¡Capitana Nyx!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:48
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_a73997fd:

    # MC @ surprised "What's the situation?"
    MC @ surprised "¿Cuál es la situación?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:49
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_0637cf87:

    # NYX @ angry "The Demorai force is even larger in scale than we anticipated."
    NYX @ angry "La fuerza demorai es aún mayor de lo que habíamos anticipado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:52
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_3541f417:

    # MC @ serious "What about those hives? Have you-"
    MC @ serious "¿Y qué hay de esas colmenas? ¿Has-?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:53
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_638bc5ba:

    # NYX @ angry "I managed to pull more guards to defend the city, but the inquisitors continued to block searches for more of those foul beasts' nests."
    NYX @ angry "Logré reunir a más guardias para defender la ciudad, pero los inquisidores siguen bloqueando las búsquedas de más colmenas de esas asquerosas bestias."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:54
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_af24b38a:

    # MC @ angry "What about Markus? Where is-"
    MC @ angry "¿Y Markus? ¿Dónde está-?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:57
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_54b023b2:

    # NYX @ angry "I need you with me, damn it!"
    NYX @ angry "¡Te necesito conmigo, maldita sea!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:58
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_bf8e12ba:

    # MC @ angry "Where is Markus? I haven't seen him since the—"
    MC @ angry "¿Dónde está Markus? No lo he visto desde—?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:63
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_c50292e2:

    # NYX @ angry "[player_name!t]!"
    NYX @ angry "¡[player_name!t]!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:63
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_17ada0d1:

    # NYX @ angry "I need you to focus and listen to me."
    NYX @ angry "Necesito que te concentres y me escuches."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:66
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_3f096c3b:

    # NYX @ angry "Markus is fine!"
    NYX @ angry "¡Markus está bien!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:67
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_c31b31c9:

    # NYX @ angry "I gave him his orders, and now I'm giving you yours!"
    NYX @ angry "¡Le di sus órdenes a él, y ahora te las doy a ti!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:70
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_8c4d3c41:

    # NYX @ angry "Head to the Market District."
    NYX @ angry "Dirígete al distrito del mercado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:71
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_d6c95501:

    # NYX @ angry "There are reports that people have begun to gather there, and I need you to break up the crowd!"
    NYX @ angry "Hay informes de que la gente ha comenzado a reunirse allí, ¡y necesito que disuelvas la multitud!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:73
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_1d08d15d:

    # NYX @ shock "You need to tell them to go home at once!"
    NYX @ shock "¡Debes decirles que se vayan a casa de inmediato!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:74
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_956cd8ab:

    # NYX @ shock "It's a fucking slaughter ground to have that many people standing out in the open!"
    NYX @ shock "¡Será una maldita matanza tener a tanta gente de pie a la intemperie!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:75
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_dd6baa11:

    # MC @ angry "What about the inquisitors?"
    MC @ angry "¿Qué hay de los inquisidores?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:76
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_64f69f68:

    # NYX @ angry "FUCK. THE FUCKING. INQUISITORS."
    NYX @ angry "QUE SE JODAN. A LOS MALDITOS. INQUISIDORES."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:77
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_136224ec:

    # NYX @ angry "Just go! I need YOU, damn it!"
    NYX @ angry "¡Solo vete! ¡Te necesito a TI, maldita sea!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:79
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_5ecef9c1:

    # MC @ angry "Why in the hells are they just standing around outside?"
    MC @ angry "¿Por qué demonios están simplemente parados afuera?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:80
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_7c62ce15:

    # NYX @ angry "Fuck if I know! NOW GO!"
    NYX @ angry "¡¡Ni puta idea!! ¡¡AHORA VETE!!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:84
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_e9cae8a9:

    # "A group of other guards were already escorting Captain Nyx off to deal with some other urgent matter, shoving scrolls and maps in her face."
    "Un grupo de otros guardias ya escoltaba a la capitana Nyx para atender otro asunto urgente, empujándole pergaminos y mapas frente al rostro."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:86
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_dc5f6a4d:

    # MC "(The Market District... I better head over there at once.)"
    MC "(El distrito del mercado... Será mejor que me dirija allí de inmediato)."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:89
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_e8081559:

    # MC "(Markus... Where are you?)"
    MC "(Markus... ¿Dónde estás?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:91
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_edcd672b:

    # MC "(I hope Markus is okay... wherever he is.)"
    MC "(Espero que Markus esté bien... donde sea que esté)."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:98
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_af75e024:

    # "At the Market District, more and more people seemed to be gathering and huddling together to listen."
    "En el distrito del mercado, cada vez más personas parecían reunirse y agruparse para escuchar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:99
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_efe0e5d3:

    # "A loud voice was talking over the murmuring of the crowd, but it was difficult to hear what was being said."
    "Una voz fuerte hablaba por encima del murmullo de la multitud, pero era difícil entender lo que se decía."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:101
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_99d656f6:

    # MC "(What in the damn hells is going on here?)"
    MC "(¿Qué demonios está pasando aquí?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:103
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_98786def:

    # "Making my way through the packed crowds, I arrived upon the makeshift stage by which the mad preacher's voice bellowed."
    "Abriéndome paso entre la multitud, llegué hasta el escenario improvisado desde el cual la voz del predicador loco retumbaba."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:106
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_d429f240:

    # MAD_PROPHET "AS I FORETOLD LONG AGO, THE GREAT NEWHEART WILL RETURN TO US IN OUR DARKEST HOUR OF NEED WHEN THE SKIES TURN RED AND THE STREETS FILL WITH BLOOD!"
    MAD_PROPHET "¡COMO PROFETICÉ HACE MUCHO TIEMPO, EL GRAN NEWHEART REGRESARÁ A NOSOTROS EN NUESTRA HORA MÁS OSCURA, CUANDO LOS CIELOS SE TORNEN ROJOS Y LAS CALLES SE LLENEN DE SANGRE!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:107
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_fcbb6cdc:

    # MAD_PROPHET "IN THIS DARKEST HOUR, WE MUST NOT SHOW FEAR!"
    MAD_PROPHET "¡EN ESTA HORA MÁS OSCURA, NO DEBEMOS MOSTRAR MIEDO!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:108
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_57aa0620:

    # MAD_PROPHET "WE MUST GATHER TO OFFER PRAISE TO THE NEW GODS FOR RESTORING OUR GREAT HERO!"
    MAD_PROPHET "¡DEBEMOS REUNIRNOS PARA OFRECER ALABANZA A LOS NUEVOS DIOSES POR RESTAURAR A NUESTRO GRAN HÉROE!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:109
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_f1a4765a:

    # "As the madman continued his speech, more and more people began to gather, crying tears of joy, clapping and cheering in the streets."
    "Mientras el loco continuaba con su discurso, más y más personas comenzaron a reunirse, llorando de alegría, aplaudiendo y vitoreando en las calles."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:112
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_dbec978f:

    # "From behind, a fiery ball launched from a catapult slammed into one of the buildings, erupting into a ball of fire and black smoke."
    "Desde atrás, una bola de fuego lanzada por una catapulta se estrelló contra uno de los edificios, estallando en una explosión de llamas y humo negro."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:113
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_bccf95aa:

    # "For a few moments, the crowd gasped in shock as the spell on them was shaken."
    "Por unos momentos, la multitud jadeó en estado de shock, como si el hechizo que los envolvía se hubiera roto."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:114
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_66a73945:

    # MAD_PROPHET "CALM YOURSELVES! DON'T LET YOUR FAITH BE SHAKEN!"
    MAD_PROPHET "¡CALMAOS! ¡NO PERMITÁIS QUE VUESTRA FE SEA SACUDIDA!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:115
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_f66ea68b:

    # MAD_PROPHET "JOIN ME IN PRAYER AND WORSHIP!"
    MAD_PROPHET "¡UNÍOS A MÍ EN ORACIÓN Y ADORACIÓN!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:116
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_4986362c:

    # "Angrily, I forced my way onto the stage, the crowd briefly turning their attention to me."
    "Enfadado, me abrí paso hacia el escenario y la multitud centró brevemente su atención en mí."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:121
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_c5fdd6ad:

    # MC @ surprised "THIS IS MADNESS! ALL OF YOU MUST GO HOME! BOARD UP YOUR WINDOWS AND DOORS AT ONCE!"
    MC @ surprised "¡ESTO ES UNA LOCURA! ¡TODOS DEBÉIS VOLVER A CASA! ¡TAPAD VUESTRAS VENTANAS Y PUERTAS DE INMEDIATO!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:122
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_55a8e2a3:

    # MAD_PROPHET "BEGONE, DECEIVER! OUR FAITH WILL NOT BE SHAKEN!"
    MAD_PROPHET "¡FUERA, EMBAUCADOR! ¡NUESTRA FE NO SERÁ QUEBRANTADA!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:123
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_a5b4625b:

    # MC @ angry "Newheart is dead, you fools! YOU'RE STANDING OUT IN THE OPEN FOR DEMORAI ARTILLERY!"
    MC @ angry "¡Newheart ha muerto, idiotas! ¡ESTÁIS EN PLENA BATALLA AQUÍ FUERA PARA LA ARTILLERÍA DEMORAI!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:124
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_11da3544:

    # "For a moment, the people once again seemed to chat amongst themselves in murmured confusion as fear began to work its way through the rows."
    "Por un momento, la gente pareció volver a charlar entre sí en una confusión murmurada mientras el miedo empezó a abrirse paso."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:128
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_44442864:

    # MAD_PROPHET "DO NOT LET YOUR HEARTS BE TAINTED BY FEAR!"
    MAD_PROPHET "¡NO DEJEN QUE SUS CORAZONES SEAN CONTAMINADOS POR EL MIEDO!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:129
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_437e7875:

    # MAD_PROPHET "YOU HAVE ALL BEEN GATHERED HERE FOR A REASON!"
    MAD_PROPHET "¡TODOS USTEDES SE HAN REUNIDO AQUÍ POR UNA RAZÓN!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:130
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_1e81b318:

    # MAD_PROPHET "SEVERAL MOONS AGO, A PALE GOD CAME TO VISIT ME IN THE FLESH WITH HIS DISCIPLES!"
    MAD_PROPHET "¡HACE VARIAS LUNAS, UN DIOS PÁLIDO VINO A VISITARME CON SUS DISCÍPULOS!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:131
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_8ab261c3:

    # MAD_PROPHET "HE PROMISED THAT THE GREAT NEWHEART REBORN WOULD REVEAL HIMSELF TO US ONCE WE HAD GATHERED HERE!"
    MAD_PROPHET "¡ÉL PROMETIÓ QUE EL GRAN NEWHEART RENACIDO SE REVELARÍA ANTE NOSOTROS UNA VEZ QUE NOS HABÍAMOS REUNIDO AQUÍ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:132
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_be7909d4:

    # MC @ surprised "(A pale... god?)"
    MC @ surprised "(¿Un dios... pálido?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:133
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_0a98655a:

    # MAD_PROPHET "JOIN ME IN PRAYER, BROTHERS AND SISTERS!"
    MAD_PROPHET "¡UNÍOS A MÍ EN ORACIÓN, HERMANOS Y HERMANAS!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:134
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_177b0d47:

    # MAD_PROPHET "THE HOUR OF OUR GREAT HERO'S REBIRTH IS UPON US!"
    MAD_PROPHET "¡LA HORA DEL RENACIMIENTO DE NUESTRO GRAN HÉROE HA LLEGADO!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:135
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_b94a80f3:

    # MAD_PROPHET "THE GODS STILL BLESS US, THEIR MOST FAVORED WORSHIPPERS!"
    MAD_PROPHET "¡LOS DIOSES AÚN NOS BENDICEN, SUS ADORADORES MÁS FAVORECIDOS!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:136
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_53293540:

    # "Looking across the sea of people, I noticed large, clumsy, hulking masses of guards stumbling their way towards the huge crowd, surrounding them."
    "Al mirar a través de la multitud, noté grandes, torpes y enormes masas de guardias que se tambaleaban mientras se dirigían hacia la enorme multitud que los rodeaba."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:141
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_c743024f:

    # "As I looked closer at the disheveled, ghastly-looking figures approaching, the terrible truth hit me."
    "Cuando miré más de cerca las figuras desaliñadas y espantosas que se acercaban, la terrible verdad me golpeó."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:142
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_4639e2f9:

    # MC "(...Oh gods.)"
    MC "(...Oh, dioses)."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:143
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_822bc9a0:

    # BLACK "{i}TRAP.{/i}"
    BLACK "{i}TRAMPA.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:144
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_e3e78986:

    # MC @ surprised "RUN! ALL OF YOU! RUN BEFORE IT'S TOO LATE!"
    MC @ surprised "¡CORRED! ¡TODOS VOSOTROS! ¡CORRED ANTES DE QUE SEA DEMASIADO TARDE!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:145
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_53ddc022:

    # MC @ surprised "THEY'RE NOT GUARDS! THEY'RE-"
    MC @ surprised "¡NO SON GUARDIAS! SON-"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:146
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_d58bcf76:

    # MAD_PROPHET "DO NOT LET YOUR FAITH WILT, MY TRUE BELIEVERS!"
    MAD_PROPHET "¡NO DEJÉIS QUE VUESTRA FE SE MARCHITE, MIS VERDADEROS CREYENTES!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:147
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_f13dfb36:

    # "At last, shambling within range of the crowd and fully circling the people, the guards began to shake violently in a spasm."
    "Por último, al arrastrarse hasta llegar al alcance de la multitud y rodearla por completo, los guardias empezaron a temblar violentamente en un espasmo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:148
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_2378439d:

    # "The crowd, noticing the strange scene occurring, turned towards the shaking guards."
    "La multitud, al notar la extraña escena que estaba ocurriendo, se giró hacia los guardias temblorosos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:149
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_3b186533:

    # "One curious boy stepped out closer towards them."
    "Un niño curioso se acercó a ellos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:151
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_0e8df3c9:

    # "As I looked closer at the disheveled, ghastly-looking figures approaching, something felt... {i}off.{/i}"
    "Mientras miraba más de cerca las figuras desaliñadas y espantosas que se acercaban, algo se sintió... {i}fuera de lugar.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:152
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_e68e6b8b:

    # BLACK "({i}DANGER.{/i})"
    BLACK "({i}PELIGRO.{/i})"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:153
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_c612bfe3:

    # MC "(What? What are you talking about?)"
    MC "(¿Qué? ¿De qué estás hablando?)"

