    MC "(...Los guardias, ¿qué están—?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:160
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_7fc09f6c:

    # "A sudden, dreadful chill rushed through me, the hairs on my arms standing up."
    "Un escalofrío repentino y terrible me recorrió el cuerpo y se me erizaron los pelos de los brazos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:164
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_57b46f4a:

    # MC @ surprised "GET AWAY FROM THEM!"
    MC @ surprised "¡ALÉJATE DE ELLOS!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:166
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_e101284f:

    # "As the child stopped in his tracks, he looked back at me for a moment in hesitation, ready to turn back."
    "El niño se detuvo en seco y me miró un momento con vacilación, a punto de darse la vuelta."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:167
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_79277854:

    # "But before he could, springing from the bloody chest of one of the guards, a pale ghoul slashed at the boy's throat."
    "Pero antes de que pudiera hacerlo, surgiendo del ensangrentado pecho de uno de los guardias, un gul pálido le cortó el cuello al niño."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:169
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_901c2e1b:

    # "The boy's parents, alongside the now panicking crowd, began to scream and try to flee, but most of them found themselves running straight into the path of more ghouls."
    "Los padres del niño, junto con la multitud ahora presa del pánico, comenzaron a gritar e intentar huir, pero la mayoría de ellos se encontraron corriendo directamente hacia el paso de más guls."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:172
