    MAD_PROPHET "¿Abandonado?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:178
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_0e2dc7f7:

    # "With a thud, the mad preacher's head hit the ground, his lifeless eyes staring blankly ahead."
    "Con un golpe seco, la cabeza del predicador loco golpeó el suelo, sus ojos sin vida mirando fijamente al frente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:180
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_79d72e0f:

    # "I reached for my sword as the ghouls moved through the crowd, tearing people limb from limb as the streets ran red with blood."
    "Alcancé mi espada mientras los guls se movían entre la multitud, despedazando a la gente miembro por miembro mientras las calles se teñían de rojo con la sangre."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:181
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_3bf57e62:

    # MC @ angry "(There's too many of them for just my blade!)"
    MC @ angry "(¡Hay demasiados para solo mi espada!)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:187
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_69530527:

    # MC @ angry "(But... There's so many eyes! If I change-)"
    MC @ angry "(Pero... ¡Hay tantos ojos! Si me tranformo-)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:189
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_39deb827:

    # "A small child, cowering in her mother's arms, screamed as one of the ghoulish creatures, claws raised, prepared to slash them down."
    "Una niña pequeña, acurrucada en los brazos de su madre, gritó mientras una de las criaturas cadavéricas, con las garras levantadas, se preparaba para atacarlas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:192
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_ab601fc9:

    # "...As the little girl closed her eyes and waited for the death blow, she must have heard the sound of something razor-sharp, but when no pain came,"
    "...Mientras la niña cerraba los ojos y esperaba el golpe mortal, debió escuchar el sonido de algo afilado como una navaja, pero cuando no sintió dolor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:197
translate es qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_1efcca36:

    # "Her eyes opened to see the hulking tentacle monster in front of her, cutting down the ghoulish beasts!"
    "Sus ojos se abrieron para ver al monstruo con tentáculos gigante frente a ella, ¡eliminando a las bestias cadavéricas!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:199
