    MC "(¡Los mataré... LOS MATARÉ A TODOS!)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1241
translate es qst_JudgementDay_GoToCentreDist_d15a4e80:

