# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1902
translate es qst_JudgementDay_GotToTheWall_22388e3f:

    # "And then, without warning, he lunged."
    "Y entonces, sin previo aviso, se abalanzó."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1912
translate es qst_JudgementDay_GotToTheWall_40b7d132:

    # "The battle was unlike anything I had faced until now."
    "La batalla fue diferente a todo lo que había enfrentado hasta ahora."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1913
translate es qst_JudgementDay_GotToTheWall_39c25025:

    # "Zanarak, despite his immense size, moved with unsettling grace—dodging effortlessly, his massive frame reacting as though unhindered by weight."
    "Zanarak, a pesar de su inmenso tamaño, se movía con una gracia inquietante, esquivando sin esfuerzo, su enorme complexión reaccionando como si no estuviera obstaculizado por el peso."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1914
translate es qst_JudgementDay_GotToTheWall_d8ea2162:

    # "Even when an attack did land, he merely shrugged it off as if it were nothing."
    "Incluso cuando un ataque lograba impactarle, él simplemente se encogía de hombros como si no fuera nada."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1915
translate es qst_JudgementDay_GotToTheWall_2e2557b1:

    # "As I glanced at my companions, exhausted and barely holding on, I realized the horrifying truth…"
    "Mientras miraba a mis compañeros, exhaustos y apenas aguantando, me di cuenta de la horrible verdad…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1916
translate es qst_JudgementDay_GotToTheWall_47ec6fe6:

