# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1917
translate es qst_JudgementDay_GotToTheWall_32467e73:

    # "He wasn't even fighting seriously."
    "He wasn't strugglingNi siquiera estaba luchando en serio."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1918
