    ERIKA "¡HRGHHH!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1920
translate es qst_JudgementDay_GotToTheWall_15950112:

    # "With a final desperate cry, Erika launched herself forward, her blade raised high."
    "Con un último grito desesperado, Erika se lanzó hacia adelante, con su hoja en alto."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1921
translate es qst_JudgementDay_GotToTheWall_4285eebc:

    # "But Zanarak was too fast."
    "Pero Zanarak fue demasiado rápido."

