    MYU "¡NO HERIR AMIGOS!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1932
translate es qst_JudgementDay_GotToTheWall_3b2ec697:

    # "Myu sprang forward, dissolving her form and wrapping herself around Zanarak's body like a suffocating mass."
    "Myu saltó hacia adelante, disolviendo su forma y envolviendo el cuerpo de Zanarak como una masa asfixiante."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:1933
