    HIRRAH "Ahora, quizá solo queden unos cientos... {i}si eso.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3812
translate es qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_Dream_Menu_7cc2b286:

    # MC "... So, we truly stand alone then?"
    MC "... Entonces, ¿estamos realmente solos?"

