    PHOAH @ talk "Está atrapado con Malakai más allá de la puerta de medianoche."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3816
translate es qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_Dream_Menu_7b5e1c34:

